Connectivity / Islands → DFS or BFS
Shortest path, equal weights → BFS (level = distance)
Shortest path, different weights → Dijkstra (min-heap)
Ordering with dependencies → Topological Sort (Kahn's)
Dynamic grouping / merge → Union-Find
2-group conflict check → Bipartite (2-coloring BFS)
Cycle in directed graph → DFS with 3 states
